{
 "name": "water_weed_draped",
 "description": "Soggy mat of aquatic weed floating at the waterline (moose food): a low, wide, lumpy green clump with tangle texture, short limp fronds flopped over its edges, strands trailing flat on the water, notched pond leaves lying on the surface, drips and ripples. No stalks, no hanging strands, no top leaf, so it can't read as a figure or a jellyfish. Anchor (0,0) = waterline at clump centre; x -255..255, y -52..30. Place at a moose's muzzle on the water line (overlap the muzzle).",
